<p>Hi <%= @user.name.presence || "there" %>,</p>

<p>
  You've been given <strong><%= @user.role.humanize.downcase %></strong> access to CertTrack,
  the ABA Ventures certificate tracker. Set your password to get started:
</p>

<p><%= link_to "Set your password", @url %></p>

<p>
  This link expires in <%= distance_of_time_in_words(0, User::INVITATION_EXPIRES_IN) %> and works once.
  If it has expired, ask an admin to resend your invite, or use "Forgot password?" on the sign-in page.
</p>

<p>Your sign-in email is <%= @user.email_address %>.</p>
